      "en": "They took their bones and buried them under the tamarisk tree in Jabesh, and fasted seven days.",
      "ko": "그 뼈를 가져다가 야베스 에셀나무 아래 장사하고 칠일을 금식하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "98bc58597c210bce15e5e306f89400cdfceeae0641121a6efc1089204b03d93d",
      "translation_text_hash": "54d6f733d5650371efced1b8e6de18c3002a67487b6a0153ac6cb8d885e3fd98",
